WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.540
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.540 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.970
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:31.550 --> 01:35.460
Surface wound on the head,
ruptured spleen, fractured femur.

01:35.460 --> 01:37.190
The idiot was being so reckless!

01:56.780 --> 01:58.270
Open up the examination table!

02:05.250 --> 02:06.910
Mother...

02:23.200 --> 02:25.970
A Team, go to formation alpha-one!

02:25.970 --> 02:27.740
B Team, let's see...

02:32.310 --> 02:34.080
Get a grip, Jura!

02:34.080 --> 02:35.620
The formation's all in pieces!

02:35.620 --> 02:37.120
I-I know.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.180
I know, but...

02:42.120 --> 02:44.130
We've lost the first rear shield!

02:44.130 --> 02:46.360
The attacks are focused
on the starboard bow!

02:46.360 --> 02:48.160
C Team, return to formation!

02:48.160 --> 02:51.000
- Where is everyone?
- Who's in charge?

02:51.000 --> 02:53.970
They even have a system
that creates dummies?

02:53.970 --> 02:56.070
- Hello? Hello?
- One more time!

02:56.070 --> 02:59.410
- I can't hear you over the static!
- Don't panic.

02:59.410 --> 03:02.380
The end result's the same
whether you're fretting or calm.

03:02.380 --> 03:04.050
And, now...

03:04.050 --> 03:06.310
Smile! Smile!

03:06.310 --> 03:07.840
Right, there you go.

03:11.490 --> 03:12.590
Damn it!

03:12.590 --> 03:14.260
Get away! Don't come here!

03:14.260 --> 03:16.390
Enemy forces are splitting
into two groups!

03:16.390 --> 03:18.590
Three more Dreads are
now critically damaged!

03:26.970 --> 03:28.030
Meia...

03:30.640 --> 03:33.470
Pai, decrease the oxygen
saturation levels.

03:33.470 --> 03:35.770
Stabilizing her bodily
functions is the priority.

03:40.450 --> 03:43.280
That's a gift from your ohma.

03:43.280 --> 03:45.250
You're such a brilliant girl.

03:45.250 --> 03:47.590
My, you've gotten so dirty!

03:47.590 --> 03:49.650
So you're going to be an ohma?

03:50.730 --> 03:53.360
Somewhere in my mind,
I had hated her.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.560
A weak mother.

03:55.560 --> 03:58.800
I thought that I had matured enough.

03:58.800 --> 04:00.200
I thought that I could protect

04:00.200 --> 04:02.290
such a mother all by myself.

04:08.180 --> 04:10.780
But in the end, I realized

04:10.780 --> 04:13.180
that I was the one being protected.

04:20.560 --> 04:22.150
I've never seen them before.

04:23.090 --> 04:25.150
Meia's tears.

04:32.400 --> 04:34.340
It's not going to end this way.

04:34.340 --> 04:35.840
Jura! Jura!

04:35.840 --> 04:37.740
Don't ask me!

04:37.740 --> 04:39.800
Come on, come on, come on!

04:42.040 --> 04:44.350
Damn it, I have no choice.

04:44.350 --> 04:46.350
Hey, UFO woman!

04:46.350 --> 04:47.420
We're combining!

04:47.420 --> 04:49.010
S-Sure.

05:06.470 --> 05:08.800
Damn it, I can't catch up.

05:08.800 --> 05:11.940
Hey, is that all
a smartaleck like you can do?

05:11.940 --> 05:12.970
Shut up!

05:12.970 --> 05:15.180
You can't even command
your own fleet well!

05:15.180 --> 05:17.310
I don't want to hear that from a man!

05:17.310 --> 05:19.050
What was that?

05:19.050 --> 05:21.950
There are too many delivery orders!

05:21.950 --> 05:25.650
We've taken Meia's leadership
for granted a little too much.

05:25.650 --> 05:29.620
We've neglected to train a sub-leader.

05:29.620 --> 05:31.890
That girl didn't allow us to.

05:32.890 --> 05:36.530
She avoided contact with people
unless absolutely necessary.

05:36.530 --> 05:39.200
That is, she avoided relying on people.

05:39.200 --> 05:41.540
From the first moment
I picked her for this group

05:41.540 --> 05:44.130
I knew this day would someday come, but...

05:59.150 --> 06:04.490
Since that accident, the eyes
of society that praised her so

06:04.490 --> 06:06.760
had turned around and become cold.

06:07.760 --> 06:10.060
And at the same time, she realized

06:10.060 --> 06:12.760
that she had nothing left.

06:18.170 --> 06:21.740
That girl is just punishing herself

06:21.740 --> 06:24.810
though it's a mistake everyone
experiences at some point.

06:24.810 --> 06:27.540
She's blaming it all
on her own weaknesses.

06:28.550 --> 06:30.890
She often said...

06:30.890 --> 06:32.790
I don't need anything important.

06:32.790 --> 06:36.060
Because those things exist,
people become weak.

06:36.060 --> 06:37.560
I want to be strong.

06:37.560 --> 06:40.860
I want strength so
that I won't be hurt,

06:40.860 --> 06:42.560
no matter what happens.

06:42.560 --> 06:43.560
Everyone!

06:43.560 --> 06:47.570
Our project will totally
speed up the development

06:47.570 --> 06:50.770
of our mother planet, Mejale.

06:50.770 --> 06:52.370
The star of Mejale

06:52.370 --> 06:55.540
has shined her spotlights on
the development of our motherland.

06:55.540 --> 06:57.910
Many donations to
the project are expected

06:57.910 --> 07:00.250
with her as the spokeswoman.

07:00.250 --> 07:02.380
Naturally, her scientist partner, Sherry

07:02.380 --> 07:04.690
supports the project fully.

07:04.690 --> 07:07.590
Their daughter Meia is also happy.

07:08.590 --> 07:10.260
Now, be on your best behavior.

07:10.260 --> 07:12.160
She has what it takes to be a star.

07:24.440 --> 07:26.110
Hey, isn't it all right?

07:26.110 --> 07:27.310
Let's see.

07:27.310 --> 07:28.780
Why don't you ask your ohma?

07:29.780 --> 07:31.210
Then it's all right.

07:33.210 --> 07:35.050
What is this?

07:35.050 --> 07:37.590
It's called "What a Wonderful World,"

07:37.590 --> 07:40.250
a song from Earth,
the planet of our ancestors.

07:42.720 --> 07:45.160
It's a gift from your ohma.

07:45.160 --> 07:47.200
And now you're making it your own?

07:47.200 --> 07:48.460
It's all right!

07:48.460 --> 07:50.830
I look better with
this than you do, Mother!

08:05.950 --> 08:07.680
I'll be back soon.

08:11.590 --> 08:13.650
We have been fooled!

08:13.650 --> 08:16.660
F. Blaschlitz Company,
responsible for technology,

08:16.660 --> 08:19.590
Andre & Hank, contracted
for plant construction,

08:19.590 --> 08:22.930
the terraforming committee,
and the senate

08:22.930 --> 08:26.030
were all discovered to be
linked to black-market money today.

08:26.030 --> 08:28.300
In the public hearing
that was conducted today,

08:28.300 --> 08:31.360
Ms. Bukowsky, the former
CEO of Andre & Hank...

08:46.820 --> 08:48.890
Districts 4 and 5 are also contaminated!

08:48.890 --> 08:50.530
Please let the children have priority!

08:50.530 --> 08:51.630
Don't break out of line!

08:51.630 --> 08:54.300
Please! Take these children with you!

08:54.300 --> 08:55.330
Mother!

08:55.330 --> 08:56.700
Mother, come with me!

08:56.700 --> 08:57.790
Mother!

09:02.140 --> 09:04.570
No, I'll stay here with you!

09:05.570 --> 09:06.700
Mother!

09:26.930 --> 09:31.470
I want to fill this
land with lots of greens

09:31.470 --> 09:34.100
so that everyone can take
an afternoon nap in peace.

09:34.100 --> 09:35.600
Or read a book.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.740
I want to make a place

09:37.740 --> 09:40.940
where everyone can feel happy
from the bottom of their hearts.

09:50.590 --> 09:52.520
I just can't do it.

09:53.450 --> 09:55.790
I can't be Meia's replacement.

09:55.790 --> 09:57.490
Don't get all high and mighty!

09:58.660 --> 10:02.960
Nobody's asking you
to be a replacement for Meia.

10:02.960 --> 10:05.300
That's why you can
relax and rely on others.

10:06.800 --> 10:08.670
Look all around you.

10:08.670 --> 10:10.810
You're Jura, not Meia.

10:10.810 --> 10:13.830
Don't bother doing what you
can't do in the first place.

10:14.840 --> 10:17.010
What can you do,
and what can't you do?

10:17.010 --> 10:19.250
That's all you need to tell everyone.

10:19.250 --> 10:21.480
When you do,
everyone else will help out.

10:28.090 --> 10:31.260
Damn it, they really piss me off.

10:31.260 --> 10:34.200
I wonder if the leader's going to die.

10:34.200 --> 10:36.830
If something like that were to happen...

10:36.830 --> 10:39.670
Grandpa always said...

10:39.670 --> 10:42.000
Even if you think, even if you worry

10:42.000 --> 10:44.670
you won't always find
an answer in every case.

10:44.670 --> 10:46.010
What's most important

10:46.010 --> 10:50.670
is whether or not you can be
yourself or not in the very end.

10:52.010 --> 10:54.350
Leave her to Duero!

10:54.350 --> 10:56.480
What we can do now

10:56.480 --> 10:58.920
is protect this ship
that the sick bay's in.

10:58.920 --> 11:00.350
Right?

11:00.350 --> 11:01.590
Yeah!

11:01.590 --> 11:03.750
Thank you, Mr. Alien.

11:04.990 --> 11:08.330
I-I'm sure that
she'd say the same thing.

11:08.330 --> 11:09.930
Everyone, listen up!

11:09.930 --> 11:12.500
Change the frequency of
the barriers and the beams!

11:12.500 --> 11:14.440
Follow the data
patterns I'm sending you!

11:14.440 --> 11:16.800
That way we won't
shoot each other down.

11:16.800 --> 11:18.010
That's right...

11:18.010 --> 11:19.570
We still had that trick left!

11:19.570 --> 11:23.540
The problem is the Paksis
fragment that entered her wound.

11:23.540 --> 11:26.680
It's creating some reaction
of its own inside her.

11:26.680 --> 11:29.920
It's starting to invade
Meia's brain cells somehow.

11:29.920 --> 11:32.650
I don't know how long her spirit
will last in the confusion

11:32.650 --> 11:35.710
that is attacking her central memory.

11:37.190 --> 11:39.260
Don't hate your ohma.

11:39.260 --> 11:41.100
Your ohma is a wonderful person.

11:41.100 --> 11:42.600
She's hard to get at

11:42.600 --> 11:44.470
and unbelievably simple-minded.

11:44.470 --> 11:47.000
But she's an honest person with no lies.

11:47.000 --> 11:51.210
She can't ignore those in need
and is always taken advantage of.

11:51.210 --> 11:55.080
But I love your ohma
so much because of that.

11:55.080 --> 11:57.240
That's why you were born.

11:57.240 --> 11:59.610
I'm sure you'll understand someday...

11:59.610 --> 12:02.820
...when someone important
to you appears in your life.

12:02.820 --> 12:04.590
I don't need something like that.

12:04.590 --> 12:08.420
If someone else gets hurt
because of me as a result...

12:09.420 --> 12:13.760
Meia, falling in love with
someone is a wonderful thing.

12:13.760 --> 12:16.560
You become strong when you
have someone you care for.

12:16.560 --> 12:17.570
No!

12:17.570 --> 12:19.770
You become weak because of that!

12:19.770 --> 12:21.400
Don't you get it already?

12:21.400 --> 12:23.890
Don't you see whose fault
it is that we feel this way?

12:30.040 --> 12:31.480
I'm sorry

12:31.480 --> 12:33.470
to have involved you in all this.

12:36.350 --> 12:38.820
I didn't mean to
say something like that.

12:39.820 --> 12:42.120
I wanted to apologize someday.

12:42.120 --> 12:44.890
But I can't tell them anymore.

12:44.890 --> 12:46.590
No matter what I say

12:46.590 --> 12:48.460
it won't reach her.

12:51.500 --> 12:52.670
You can do it!

12:52.670 --> 12:54.030
Live!

12:54.030 --> 12:56.030
I don't want to anymore.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.840
The port arm has been hit!

13:03.840 --> 13:04.980
The ship's tilting!

13:04.980 --> 13:07.850
Decks 6 through 9 have lost all power!

13:07.850 --> 13:09.780
Shield strength has decreased even more!

13:09.780 --> 13:11.590
Dread team, when can you head out?

13:11.590 --> 13:13.450
There's no use worrying about all this!

13:14.520 --> 13:16.460
I've got a plan.

13:16.460 --> 13:19.360
You can't possibly be
thinking of dying for this?

13:19.360 --> 13:20.830
You've got to be kidding.

13:20.830 --> 13:22.900
I'm not dying for women.

13:22.900 --> 13:25.960
Besides, I haven't eaten
what you guys call "pescatore"!

13:26.970 --> 13:29.370
If this works,
I'll let you eat until you die.

13:29.370 --> 13:32.130
Yeah! If I'm going to die,
that's a much better way of dying!

13:35.610 --> 13:37.550
Look at that girl over there.

13:37.550 --> 13:39.250
She survived the accident on the surface.

13:39.250 --> 13:41.440
Oh, the one that's
been acting like a star?

13:45.350 --> 13:46.820
Why?

13:46.820 --> 13:49.450
Why am I the only one
that has to feel this way?

13:57.360 --> 14:00.100
I don't want to keep living anymore.

14:00.100 --> 14:03.070
Someone, please spare me and...

14:03.070 --> 14:05.970
You sure grew up spoiled, didn't you?

14:07.370 --> 14:10.910
Do you want others to
decide how you'll die as well?

14:10.910 --> 14:14.440
If you're willing to die,
I can give you a place to die.

14:25.930 --> 14:29.260
That girl learned everything
as if her life depended on it.

14:29.260 --> 14:31.530
She seemed to have
potential to begin with.

14:31.530 --> 14:35.670
She quickly learned
how to control the Dreads.

14:35.670 --> 14:37.170
Meia.

14:37.170 --> 14:38.370
You can't die yet.

14:38.370 --> 14:41.140
You haven't fulfilled
your debt to me yet.

14:41.140 --> 14:43.740
I've gotten pretty hungry already!

14:43.740 --> 14:45.210
We'll finish this in one shot!

14:45.210 --> 14:47.750
All right, everyone, tighten
the straps on your loincloths!

14:47.750 --> 14:49.180
What's that?

14:52.450 --> 14:53.790
There's only one chance.

14:53.790 --> 14:56.420
If we fail, Meia's brain
will never be the same again.

15:09.800 --> 15:11.210
Ow!

15:11.210 --> 15:12.510
Not yet?

15:12.510 --> 15:13.500
Not yet...

15:19.450 --> 15:22.640
- Meia!
- Please come back, Meia.

15:23.980 --> 15:25.210
Just a bit more!

15:27.550 --> 15:29.580
The shield is down to the third level!

15:30.820 --> 15:31.880
Distance: 1200!

15:35.560 --> 15:36.700
Distance: 900!

15:36.700 --> 15:37.990
All right!

15:47.570 --> 15:49.170
Meia, be strong!

15:50.180 --> 15:52.050
Please forgive your ohma.

15:52.050 --> 15:54.320
No, I'll stay here with you!

15:54.320 --> 15:57.690
Why do you close your heart so much?

15:57.690 --> 15:59.120
Nothing's so important...

15:59.120 --> 16:01.280
You should live a little easier.

16:02.060 --> 16:03.520
Are you an idiot?

16:06.460 --> 16:08.890
Why... do you...

16:25.650 --> 16:28.740
Now... with this, I can peacefully...

16:31.120 --> 16:32.110
Meia!

16:35.060 --> 16:36.060
I can't take this!

16:36.060 --> 16:37.460
Don't give up so easily!

16:38.490 --> 16:40.560
The fun's just about to begin!

16:40.560 --> 16:41.550
Let's go!

17:02.180 --> 17:03.880
What an idea.

17:03.880 --> 17:06.190
Using his allies for reflection...

17:06.190 --> 17:09.850
For a half-baked idea from a guy,
it's a relatively good one.

17:19.800 --> 17:23.140
I'm a very weak person.

17:23.140 --> 17:28.080
I didn't have the courage to
go outside like you or your ohma.

17:28.080 --> 17:30.810
My dream was at the very
least to create a place

17:30.810 --> 17:35.080
where you could relax in
safety when you two came home.

17:35.080 --> 17:37.580
When you were happy
or when you were sad,

17:37.580 --> 17:40.150
When you were full of
energy or when you were tired,

17:40.150 --> 17:42.160
A place where I could greet you

17:42.160 --> 17:45.960
with a "welcome home" no
matter what kind of day it was.

17:45.960 --> 17:46.990
That's not it!

17:46.990 --> 17:49.160
You weren't weak, Mother!

17:49.160 --> 17:51.770
I was the one that was weak!

17:51.770 --> 17:54.200
I didn't have the courage
to understand others' feelings.

17:54.200 --> 17:56.940
I was afraid of showing
others how I felt.

17:56.940 --> 17:59.940
I was afraid of not being liked.

17:59.940 --> 18:01.110
Meia...

18:01.110 --> 18:06.410
You really are a girl with very kind
feelings and a very strong will.

18:06.410 --> 18:09.520
So you don't have to
blame yourself anymore.

18:09.520 --> 18:12.290
You have nothing to fear now.

18:12.290 --> 18:14.320
Open up your heart.

18:14.320 --> 18:17.160
People can't live by themselves.

18:17.160 --> 18:21.060
Go find the place
where you can return to.

18:21.060 --> 18:24.200
Where the people who
hold you dear are waiting...

18:24.200 --> 18:25.190
Wait!

18:27.000 --> 18:28.700
Mother, wait.

18:28.700 --> 18:30.870
I still have things to tell you.

18:30.870 --> 18:32.200
Things I want you to hear.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.910
- Meia!
- Leader!

18:35.910 --> 18:36.980
Come back!

18:36.980 --> 18:38.050
Meia!

18:38.050 --> 18:39.050
Stop it.

18:39.050 --> 18:40.140
Leave me alone!

18:41.520 --> 18:43.210
I... I...

18:48.120 --> 18:50.650
- Meia, thank goodness!
- She's been saved!

18:52.130 --> 18:54.150
Look at the two of you...

18:56.700 --> 18:58.400
No need to worry.

18:58.400 --> 18:59.630
It's here.

18:59.630 --> 19:01.620
It seems it's something
important to you.

19:03.700 --> 19:04.840
No.

19:04.840 --> 19:07.360
That's a lesson for me.

20:43.300 --> 20:45.130
They all did their best.

20:46.840 --> 20:48.840
Captain...

20:48.840 --> 20:50.410
But it's strange.

20:50.410 --> 20:52.050
He's your exact opposite.

20:52.050 --> 20:53.950
This idiot who shows all his emotions.

20:55.250 --> 20:59.090
He's gotten inside everyone's
hearts before we knew it.

20:59.090 --> 21:02.920
Perhaps you and he are a lot alike.

21:02.920 --> 21:06.790
The only difference is how
open you are with your feelings.

21:06.790 --> 21:08.300
Captain...

21:08.300 --> 21:11.530
Isn't it about time
that you gave forgiveness?

21:11.530 --> 21:12.730
To yourself, that is.

21:32.150 --> 21:37.760
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.760 --> 21:43.260
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.260 --> 21:49.500
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.500 --> 21:59.810
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.810 --> 22:02.350
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.350 --> 22:14.130
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.130 --> 22:25.740
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.740 --> 22:37.550
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.550 --> 22:51.420
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
